Alembic migration environment for the Tandem backend.

The database URL is read from environment variables via app.core.config, not
from alembic.ini.

Common commands (run from backend/, or use the root Makefile):

    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add stations table"
    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic downgrade -1
    uv run alembic current
    uv run alembic history

alembic/versions/ is empty until the first domain model is added. The PostGIS
extension itself is created by the Docker Compose init script
(scripts/init_postgis.sql), not by a migration.
